{
  "_comment": "CDP Tools replay sequence. Load with: replay({ action: \"load\", filename: \"<this-file>\" }), then run with: replay({ action: \"run\", name: \"<this-file>\" }). What the app did under each step, and the responses that answer it on replay, are in the file of the same name under activity/.",
  "id": "seq-1790650000000-1",
  "name": "state-lifecycle",
  "description": "Every store the page keeps, written, changed, reloaded, removed and cleared again",
  "expectedOutcome": "Each store's rows read set, then changed, survive the reload, then read removed; the second clear records nothing",
  "startUrl": "http://localhost:7788/",
  "commands": [
